Historical records are frozen, non-normative evidence.

The default branch must not keep obsolete historical taskpack bodies mixed into `taskpacks/current/`.

The frozen pre-cleanup corpus is retrieved by immutable ref:

`803268da9dc356fe63f26b3b5405f724bc06b5b9`

Cloud GPT audits MUST NOT bulk-search historical corpora by default. They may consult history only after the current authority identifies a specific unresolved historical question.

Historical material cannot satisfy current Done-When unless current code/readback independently proves the claim.

