## 14. Authority change procedure

This document changes only when:
1. the user explicitly changes a project-level decision; or
2. current exact-SHA implementation proves a documented fact obsolete and the change is accepted through the current taskpack.

Every authority change must update this document, the machine authority index, and affected current task/open-task records, while preserving the old version in Git history.

No subordinate document may silently redefine WORK-LAB.
